{"4456460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kopernicus: Incremental Suffering", "steam_appid": 4456460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/cba4118f1683c86cb78799d11ed62d61.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/cba4118f1683c86cb78799d11ed62d61.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/cba4118f1683c86cb78799d11ed62d61.mp4?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-bit top-down incremental horror with a cozy/gore feel. The SCC KOPERNICUS exploration ship crashes at the edge of known space. The biologist-cosmonaut must endure the horrors to EXTRACT his fragmented memories. Build your base, survive the night, and uncover the hidden truth. There is no escape from  T H E   T H I N G S  you love.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/83ae013a533f2b723f1ef65c1b062ddc.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/83ae013a533f2b723f1ef65c1b062ddc.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/83ae013a533f2b723f1ef65c1b062ddc.mp4?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a forsaken planetoid. Your suit is miraculously intact, and the sublimators can generate oxygen from the dusty atmosphere. But your ultimate survival is still a distant dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the horizon you see the burning wreck of the SCC KOPERNICUS. The WANDA escape capsule ejected you at just the right moment. From a distance you hear a demonic blood-curdling groan. Your hands clench your only means of defense: an anti-rust aerosol can and a lighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/2c0575e26d82d343047f2ff5258f67fb.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/2c0575e26d82d343047f2ff5258f67fb.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/2c0575e26d82d343047f2ff5258f67fb.mp4?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the husk of the last creature smoulders at your feet, your mind is filled with darkness deeper than the night that surrounds you. Your memories are but shadows. You must construct the WERNYHORA Extractor and performing neural tissue biopsies using the K3MIX device. Perhaps then you will understand why longing tears at your heart more fiercely than the instinct to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/a6e8faab33498bf9ba429fcb7a39412b.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/a6e8faab33498bf9ba429fcb7a39412b.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/a6e8faab33498bf9ba429fcb7a39412b.mp4?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incremental Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the night. Collect their essence to build your base. Unlock increasingly powerful tools and horrifying revelations. An incremental game based on action over idling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/c770687b48970a4238239ffb4e89601c.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/c770687b48970a4238239ffb4e89601c.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/c770687b48970a4238239ffb4e89601c.mp4?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Burn Them All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade a powerful arsenal of flame-based weaponry. Arm yourself with tanks, robots, and devastating orbital weaponry. Survive as prey. Become the predator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/632251150953646c026808b8d6887e94.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/632251150953646c026808b8d6887e94.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/632251150953646c026808b8d6887e94.mp4?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Your Fears</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not prepared for what hunts you. Steel your nerves and face what lurks in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/7a842fcd6e0306cd7dcc9186ca1d5850.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/7a842fcd6e0306cd7dcc9186ca1d5850.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/7a842fcd6e0306cd7dcc9186ca1d5850.mp4?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incrementally upgrade your base, fire-based weaponry and robotic units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive nightmares born from the shadows of your mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract memories using the K3MIX device</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather knowledge about terrifying organisms beyond human understanding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience suffering in forms you fear to imagine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Polish culture, myths, and beliefs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a rocket to escape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>   </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/cba4118f1683c86cb78799d11ed62d61.poster.avif?t=1785331217\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/extras/cba4118f1683c86cb78799d11ed62d61.webm?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https