?t=1785331217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incrementally upgrade your base, fire-based weaponry and robotic units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive nightmares born from the shadows of your mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract memories using the K3MIX device</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather knowledge about terrifying organisms beyond human understanding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience suffering in forms you fear to imagine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Polish culture, myths, and beliefs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a rocket to escape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>   </p>", "short_description": "Burn. Build. Survive. Escape. Wield the Drillgun to dig for fuel and incinerate nightmares, expand your ever-growing base and unlock devastating new weapons. Every night the planet grows stronger. So do you. Recover forgotten memories and fight your way off the planet.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/31456faac6bf50b665c329c27bdf8f6b26f152fa/header.jpg?t=1785331217", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/fd00414719a6b7018e03e4bc53084d9394b3d4e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785331217", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456460/fd00414719a6b7018e03e4bc53084d9394b3d4e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785331217", "website": "https://www.lukasik.art/kopernicus", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3220 CPU @ 3.30GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel HD Graphics<br></li>